IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPINTRONIC-DW.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-Q4-BLOCKS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 NANOWIRE-TRACKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SPIN-TORQUE-HEADS   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPIN-DW.
    IF NUM-Q4-BLOCKS == 0 OR NANOWIRE-TRACKS == 0 OR SPIN-TORQUE-HEADS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 248600 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-Q4-BLOCKS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
